title: Fixed University pack-selector ignored by read tools (v6.6.4)
summary: While authoring a private multi-section University pack (ai-literacy), discovered that paradigm_university_search/onboard/validate accept a `pack` selector but ignore it — they resolve the correct packRoot then call a loader hardcoded to the project index.yaml, so non-default packs return 0. Two hardcodes (project-index path + content/-only base; first-party ships src/content/). Fixed with a pack-root-aware loader + scan fallback. Architect-designed, builder-implemented, reviewer-approved, 274 tests pass.
